    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43297" root="لسن" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِسَانٌ</span></b>  of a sandal, The <i>thing</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَنَة</span>) <i>projecting
in the fore part</i> thereof. (TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْرَدٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِسَانٌ</span> The <i>tongue</i> [or <i>cock</i>] of a balance: see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْجَمٌ</span> in the S and K. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِسَانٌ</span> <i>In formation,
news,</i> or <i>tidings;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَرٌ</span>. (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">علو</span>.) See
a verse cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلْوٌ</span>.

